<title>UK: TABLE-Grampian Television year profits up.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Grampian Television year profits up.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to February 28, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		14.5		  vs 11.6</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	  5.25		 vs  4.15</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)  7.25		 vs  5.40</p>
<p> Pretax		     11.82		 vs  5.78</p>
<p> Turnover		   24.14		 vs 24.82</p>
<p>NOTE - Pretax profit includes 4.66 million stg profit on sale of SCOT FM. The company said profit adjusted to exclude SCOT FM sale was up 24 percent on year. Earnings per share adjusted to exclude SCOT FM sale. Earnings before adjustment were 25.7 pence for current year.</p>
<p>Full company name - Grampian Television Plc.</p>
</text>
